THREAD C: residue-only law -- robust finite certificate (3 full periods)
========================================================================
  pairs checked: 1207; residue classes with >1 distinct e: 0
  => e is CONSTANT on each (p%7,q%7) class over 3+ periods. Residue-only CERTIFIED.

  Minimal period in p (fix q=5): e(p,5) for p=1..15 (coprime):
    p= 1 (p%7=1): e=(2, 2, 2, -5, 2, 2, -5)
