    p=13 (p%7=6): e=(5, -2, -2, 5, -2, -2, -2)
    p=14 (p%7=0): e=(0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0)
    period-7 in p: True;  non-constant (genuine mod-7): True

CONCLUSION: e_j = E_j(p mod 7, q mod 7) is a CERTIFIED residue-only invariant.
Hence S=sum|e| = 4 f(||p||_7,||q||_7) is a FINITE 7x7 table; the sharp window
faces 12p (at 3/2) and 20q (at 2/1) are forced by the smallest-denominator members.
